        {
          "id": 1045488704,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "It's an ugly solution, but not the only issue. Take a look at the ConversationDialog constructor and the connect statements. The ones in EndpointDialog should copy the ones in ConversationDialog. Especially the tabbar connect is missing in EndpointDialog.\n\nBesides that, I can't find a better solution that fast, but to rewrite the constructors is on my plan anyway. So update the Signal/slot connections and it should work.",
